      "description": "One per committed ledger entry; the kind is the last segment of the event name, so a preset needs no tag for it. `reference` is the caller's idempotency key and in a Pro deployment it carries payment identifiers: metadata only, never a tag and never an unredacted log.",
      "emitter": "AuroraMeter.Credits.Ledger",
      "event": "[:aurora_meter, :credits, kind]",
